      "gameReleaseId": "pokemon-scarlet-violet",
      "knowledgeReleaseId": "",
      "dataReleaseId": "pokeapi-reference-v1",
      "language": "zh-CN",
      "dlcId": "",
      "contractVersion": "v1",
      "text": "| 成员 | 等级 | 属性 / 太晶 | 特性 | 已核实招式 |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| 百合根娃娃 | 16 | 草 | 我行我素 | 催眠粉 / 超级吸取 |\n| 迷你芙 | 16 | 草 / 一般 | 早起 | 撞击 / 飞叶快刀 |\n| 树才怪 | 17 | 岩石 → 草 | 结实 | 起草 / 落石 |\n\n"
    }
  },
  {
    "schemaVersion": "1",
    "eventId": 11,
    "type": "answer.delta",
    "sessionId": "33d49c27-f04d-4305-9e7c-7fbad8b41b7c",
